@startuml UC10_View_Aggregated_Forecast_Activity_Diagram

title UC10: View Aggregated Forecast - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "View Aggregate Forecast" option;

partition "Calculate Aggregates (UC12)" {
  :System calculates aggregated forecasts;
  :System selects best-rated service per city;
}

:System retrieves aggregated forecast data;

if (Multiple services have data?) then (yes)
  :System displays forecast from service
  with maximum average rating for each city;
  :System shows rating score and service name for each city;
else (single service only)
  :System displays that service's forecast;
  :System indicates aggregation not applicable;
endif

stop

@enduml
